  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dowlad-kaab Program - Joint Programme Stregthening Local Governance and Decentralized Service Delivery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dowladkaab Programme will have lighter footprints inSomaliland and Puntland, primarily to further institutionalize local governance, deepen knowledge management anduse their relatively advanced capabilities as an innovation hub to showcase on the best practices and lessons learntfor adaptability and scalibiltiy, additionally the graduation strategy of SL and PL including for other interventiondistricts will be developed during the implenetation phase from the 2nd year of the implementation. Duri</narrative>
  </description>
